# IMX round 4: the Synth Automation slots in project.mtff on Tracker+ (partAuto.h, synth.N.auto.K lines of mtff_codec.h, projectSidecar.cpp applySynthAuto).
# Slot 1 of Synth 1 is set to an LFO on Part Pan through the page (F3, Down), the setup pokes (plus_flows.sh) put an Envelope on Part Delay in slot 4 of
# Synth 3, save the project (fmsave), take both slots Off, open the saved project (fmopen) and read the slots back. Ends on the poke trace (UISHOT_TRACE_PARTAUTO and
# the closing `partauto 2` read): both slots are back, field for field, after the reload
title: Synth Automation slots saved in project.mtff on Tracker+ (IMX round 4)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
tap Params
wait 1200ms
tap Params
wait 1200ms
tap Params
wait 1500ms
expect text "Synth Automation 3/4"
expect text "Destination"
tap F3
wait 400ms
tap Down
wait 1500ms
expect text "Shape"
expect text "Speed"
shot synthauto-lfo
wait 32000ms
shot synthauto-reloaded
